SUMMARY:Four In One: Celebrating The Music of Thelonious Monk (Night 2 of 2)
DESCRIPTION:Nancy Walker – piano\nPat LaBarbera – saxophone\nDan Fortin – bass\nEthan Ardelli – drums \nPlumbing the depths of Thelonious Monk’s canon is the Toronto-based quartet ‘Four In One’.  The group is comprised of 2026 JUNO nominee pianist Nancy Walker\, saxophone legend Pat Labarbera\, bassist Dan Fortin\, and drummer Ethan Ardelli. \n \nCOVER: $25
URL:https://jazzbistro.ca/event/four-in-one-celebrating-the-music-of-thelonious-monk-night-2-of-2/
END:VEVENT
