SUMMARY:The Rohaam Keyvani Trio
DESCRIPTION:Rohaam Keyvani – piano\nChristopher Parnis – bass\nNorbert Botos – drums\n\n\n\nCOVER: $20\n\nRohaam Keyvani is a performing pianist in the Toronto area. He has played with many recognized players based in cities such as New York City\, Paris\, Barcelona\, and more. He has studied with notable musicians based in Toronto\, along with established pianists based in New York City\, such as pianist Adam Birnbaum. Through his trio works across established venues in Toronto\, Rohaam honours many past influences such as Wynton Kelly\, Bud Powell\, Sonny Clark\, Oscar Peterson\, and many more.
URL:https://jazzbistro.ca/event/the-rohaam-keyvani-trio/
END:VEVENT
