SUMMARY:Gentiane MG
DESCRIPTION:Gentiane MG – piano\nLevi Dover – bass\nMarc Nelso – drums \n \nCOVER: $25 \nABOUT GENTIANE MG \nGentiane Michaud Gagnon\, known professionally as Gentiane MG\, is a pianist and composer based in Montreal whose music explores human connection\, emotional depth\, and the relationship between inner life and the natural world. A JUNO and ADISQ nominee\, she has earned international recognition for emotionally resonant piano trio work that blends contemporary jazz\, classical influence\, and poetic musical storytelling. Her fourth album\, Can You Hear the Birds? was released on March 27\, 2026.
URL:https://jazzbistro.ca/event/gentiane-mg-3/
END:VEVENT
